<h1>Downloads</h1>
<p>Before installation follow these steps:
  <ul>
    <li>Uninstall any previous version of these filters. (This is important!)<br/>
        Go to "Add/Remove Programs", remove oggcodecs.</li>
    <li>Make sure media player or any directshow applications are closed.</li>
    <li>Run the installer.</li>
  </ul>
  
  Then Windows Media Player or any other DirectShow application (e.g. BSPlayer) will be able to play Ogg Vorbis, Ogg Speex, Ogg Theora, Ogg FLAC, native FLAC, and WebM files.
</p>

<h2>Binaries</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Windows 32/64-bit Installer: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/opencodecs_0.85.17777.exe">opencodecs_0.85.17777.exe</a> 2,53MB</li>
    <li>Windows Mobile 5.0 - 6.5 cab package: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/opencodecs_0.84.17359-wm5.cab">opencodecs_0.84.17359-wm5.cab</a> 536KB</li>
</ul>

<p>You may also <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/">browse</a>
the download directory if you are looking for a specific version.<br/> 
The installers are digitally signed with a certificate provided by <a target="_new" href="http://www.certum.eu/">Unizeto Certum</a>.
</p>

<h2>Source Code</h2>
<ul>
<li>Source code: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/opencodecs_0.85.17777_src.7z">opencodecs_0.85.17777_src.7z</a> 6,00MB</li>
</ul>

<p>The latest development version is always available through SVN at <a href="http://svn.xiph.org/trunk/oggdsf/">http://svn.xiph.org/trunk/oggdsf/</a>
</p>

<h2>Debug symbols</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Windows 32/64-bit: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/opencodecs_0.85.17777_pdbs.7z"> opencodecs_0.85.17777_pdbs.7z</a> 6,89MB</li>
    <li>Windows Mobile 5.0 - 6.5: <a href="http://downloads.xiph.org/releases/oggdsf/opencodecs_0.84.17359_pdbs-wm5.7z"> opencodecs_0.84.17359_pdbs-wm5.7z</a> 1,06MB</li>
</ul>

